msgid "Wait a minute!"
msgstr "Стояти!"

#. Key: ARK7_005
#. Source: story/storytext_mainar (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainar.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arakune story route (POV: Arakune)
#. JA: 天が呼ぶ地が呼ぶ人が呼ぶ！
#. JA:   愛と正義の救世主、シシガミ＝バング、見参！
msgctxt "ARK7_005"
msgid ""
"The heavens, earth, and people call upon me!\n"
"The savior of love and justice, Bang Shishigami! Here I come!\n"
msgstr ""
"Небо кличе, земля кличе, люди кличуть! Рятівник любові й\n"
"справедливості, Банґ Шішіґамі, прибув!"

#. Key: ARK7_006
#. Source: story/storytext_mainar (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainar.pac)
