msgid ""
"      body...   feeling o   ...\n"
"    ...not...mov     prop     ...           cause          smell...?\n"
"       smell      his swelt       sweat     smell..."
msgstr ""
"Тіло... щось не так. Погано рух ється... Че ез   запах...? Цей задуш  вий\n"
"сморід поту..."

#. Key: ARK7_020
#. Source: story/storytext_mainar (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainar.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arakune story route (POV: Arakune)
#. JA: お主はそのような妙ちきりんな仮面など被っておるから
#. JA:   心根が捻じ曲がってしまうのでござる！
#. JA:   どれ、拙者が剥がしてやるでござる！
msgctxt "ARK7_020"
msgid ""
"Your personality is probably just as twisted as that eerie mask you always wear!\n"
"Take that off, and show me your true colors!"
msgstr "Твоя душа скривилася через цю дивакувату маску! Ану, я її з тебе здеру!"

#. Key: ARK7_022
#. Source: story/storytext_mainar (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainar.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arakune story route (POV: Arakune)
#. JA: アアアアアアアア！
msgctxt "ARK7_022"
msgid "Aaaaaaaaah!"
msgstr "А-а-а-а-а-а-а-а!"

#. Key: ARK7_023
#. Source: story/storytext_mainar (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainar.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arakune story route (POV: Arakune)
#. JA: む？
#. JA:   想像以上に固いでござるな？
msgctxt "ARK7_023"
msgid ""
"Hm?\n"
"It's not...coming...off!"
msgstr "Гм? Вона твердіша, ніж я гадав."

#. Key: ARK7_025
#. Source: story/storytext_mainar (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainar.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arakune story route (POV: Arakune)
#. JA: こらあ！
#. JA:   往生際の悪い男め！
#. JA:   観念して素顔を晒さぬか！
msgctxt "ARK7_025"
msgid ""
"I tell you, resistance is futile!\n"
"Give up, and show me what you're hiding behind that mask!"
msgstr ""
"Ану годі! Не вмієш ти програвати! Змирися й покажи своє справжнє\n"
"обличчя!"

#. Key: ARK7_027
#. Source: story/storytext_mainar (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainar.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arakune story route (POV: Arakune)
