#. JA:   これだけやっても剥がれぬとは……。
msgctxt "ARK7_027"
msgid ""
"*wheeze* *wheeze*\n"
"How... Is this possible...!?"
msgstr "Ха, ха... Навіть так не знімається..."

#. Key: ARK7_028
#. Source: story/storytext_mainar (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainar.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arakune story route (POV: Arakune)
#. JA: ウ、ウア、ア、ア……。
msgctxt "ARK7_028"
msgid "U...aa...ahh...ahhh."
msgstr "У, у-а, а, а..."

#. Key: ARK7_029
#. Source: story/storytext_mainar (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainar.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arakune story route (POV: Arakune)
msgctxt "ARK7_029"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

