#. Source: story/storytext_mainar (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainar.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arakune story route (POV: Arakune)
#. JA: ……も、もしや、それが素顔でござるか？
msgctxt "ARK7_030"
msgid "D-Don't tell me... That's your true face?"
msgstr "Н-невже це і є твоє справжнє обличчя?"

#. Key: ARK7_031
#. Source: story/storytext_mainar (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainar.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arakune story route (POV: Arakune)
#. JA: ウウ……。
msgctxt "ARK7_031"
msgid "Oogh..."
msgstr "У-у..."

#. Key: ARK7_032
#. Source: story/storytext_mainar (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainar.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arakune story route (POV: Arakune)
#. JA: ということは、もしかして、お主…………………………………………
#. JA:   …………………………………………………………………………
#. JA:   ……………………………………正真正銘の“物の怪”でござるか？
msgctxt "ARK7_032"
